  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mekmO2e2\">该接口用于校验转化数据回传时，携带的app_access_token动态身份标识，是否可校验通过。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-6NYtTYzd\">业务使用场景说明：<a href=\"https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/docx/ZrzEd4n2SoNJRwxFu0VcGUxxnle\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">转化数据回传新标准202303</a></p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201782538872833228%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-BSZ4MKjJ\" id=\"h346b9f0-BSZ4MKjJ\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-7WjspiQu\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/serve_market/cid/verify_token/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/serve_market/cid/verify_token/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1782609755121690\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-V3aTgMgc\" id=\"h346b9f0-V3aTgMgc\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-AaLkVyWl\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ZusPNmtX\" id=\"h346b9f0-ZusPNmtX\">Header</h1><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-custom=\"true\" data-id=\"t965bc8b